Georg Reisacher wrote:
> 
> /usr/lib/cmplrs/cc/cfe: Warning: /usr/include/db.h:74: Macro __signed
> redefined.
> .
> .
> .
> -ldbm -ldb -lresolv
> ld:
> Can't locate file for: -ldb

See READ_ME and src/READ_ME in the sendmail distribution concerning
NEWDB.

On Digital UNIX V3.2x, you'll have to either install the Berkeley NEWDB
package as described or remove -DNEWDB and -ldb from the Makefile. The
latter is easier if you have no special requirements.

On Digital UNIX V4.0, newdb is included and you'll probably want to
instead remove NDBM (-DNDBM and -ldbm) from the Makefile.

