> The forbidden modules are the 'Open3D' and 'MultiMedia Services'
> modules.  I removed them by using the setld -d <module names> as shown
> in the docs.  A 'setld -i' retains the names (of all 7 Open3D modules
> and all 17 Multimedia Services modules), but the 'installed' is gone
> from the output listing.  What am I doing wrong??  I've tried to reboot
> a couple of times to no avail.  Can I get a list of installed modules
> which are blocking the install script from somewhere??
> 
