> psmith01@mindspring.com


	You should first verify that the products have indeed been removed from
the system by performing the following commands:

# ls /usr/.smdb./O3D*.lk
# ls /usr/.smdb./MME*.lk

	If either command returns any data then the subsets listed are still
installed on the system and these are the subsets that are keeping the
update installation from continuing.  If there are no subsets installed,
you should be able to perform the update installation.  If the update
continues to request that products be removed let me know. 


