Brian O'Neill  <Brian_ONeill@uml.edu> wrote:
]I'm trying to test what will happen on our Mail servers if we upgrade
]out Netscape Mail Server to Messaging server.
]
]I installed 4.0D out of the box on a test system, and tried to install
]the Netscape Directory server. When I ran "ns-setup", I got the
]following error:
]
]533:./ns-setup: /sbin/loader: Fatal Error: object libcurses.so from
]liblist in ./ns-setup has version "osf.1", which does not match the
]found object: /usr/shlib/libcurses.so (with version "xpg4")
