I have had some success with a Lexmark laser printer.  First, I set it to
PCL mode then used my handy-dandy PCL2 reference sheet to set up 2 pcl
files:
one containing
   <Esc>E<Esc>&l1O
and one with just
  <Esc>E

<Esc> is character 27.

I then took my output and cat it with the escape setups

cat $PCLSETUP/hpland.pcl MYREPORT.RPT $PCLSETUP/hpreset.pcl > MYREPORT.HP
lpr -Plexmark MYREPORT.HP

I have also been able to use this method to cat a report from the
application with a form layout, e.g. print a purchase order on a purchase
order form using blank paper in the printer.

Good Luck

